		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Emerald-green giant with one snake-like eye and fierce, hooked claws. Fears deep water, cannot swim.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 rend +5 (1d10 + crush) or howl, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Crush</strong>. Deals an extra die of damage if it hits the same target with both claws.</p><p></p><p><strong>Howl</strong>. All within double near, WIS 12+ or terrified for 1d4 rounds. Heard for miles. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
